# Voice loop build phases

When working on Talk, LiveKit, mic UI, voice agent, or voice ordering:

1. Read [`docs/voice-loop-build-phases.md`](../../docs/voice-loop-build-phases.md) and state which **phase** you are implementing.
2. Treat phases as independently testable gates — especially **Phase 1 (level metering → orb)** before STT/agent/commerce.
3. Architecture source of truth: [`docs/voice-app-architecture.md`](../../docs/voice-app-architecture.md).
4. Product wiring: [`docs/implementation/voice-ordering.md`](../../docs/implementation/voice-ordering.md).
5. Do not add Sarvam, OpenAI, or Swiggy into Phases 0–1.
6. Agent must never gain a `placeOrder` tool; Place order stays on cart review.
